    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not the same though. you can't find meaning in a void. i look at the last two decades and it's just a massive deficit. i'm just so tired of trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. it feels like i'm just pouring water into a bucket with no bottom. i'm just done trying to fight it.",
